      "id": "c4743d1f",
      "diagram": "diagram/c4743d1f.png",
      "class": "Mechanism Diagram",
      "domain": "1",
      "title": "Neuro–immune interactions in colorectal cancer: mechanistic insights and therapeutic implications within the tumor immune microenvironment",
      "authors": "Hongbin Zhen; Chunxia Wang; Xia Wang; Huanyuan Huang; Jun Li; Meie Zhao",
      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1\n\nBidirectional brain–gut–tumor neuro-immune axis in colorectal cancer. The central nervous system communicates with the gut and colorectal tumor microenvironment through the hypothalamic–pituitary–adrenal (HPA) axis, autonomic nervous system (sympathetic and parasympathetic pathways), and sensory neural circuits. Stress-associated neuroendocrine and neural signals propagate downward to modulate local immune states, whereas tumor- and gut-derived signals feed back to the brain via neural and humoral routes. The enteric nervous system (ENS) functions as a local integrative hub, coordinating central neural inputs with tumor-associated immune regulation. Created in BioRender. Zhao, M. (2026) https://BioRender.com/l9tuygw.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://doi.org/10.3389/fimmu.2026.1852495",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "condition": "Specific BioRender page explicitly licenses this Completed Graphic under CC BY 4.0; individual BioRender icons may not be extracted and redistributed separately. Article permissions cover the saved author text under CC BY 4.0. Selected excerpts and captions contain no identified credit requiring separate permission. Other article images are omitted. Image bytes unchanged; complete BioRender public PNG, no cropping or icon extraction. Original-language article paragraphs and linked captions converted from JATS XML to Markdown; styling removed, no OCR, translation or paraphrase. Graphic: Figure 1. Bidirectional brain–gut–tumor neuro-immune axis in colorectal cancer.. Creator: Dwad Dwad. Provider: BioRender. Asset source: https://biorender.com/l9tuygw. License evidence: https://app.biorender.com/citation/6a79d17fa56c4db9359c3612. “Figure 1. Bidirectional brain–gut–tumor neuro-immune axis in colorectal cancer.” created in BioRender. Dwad, D. (https://BioRender.com/l9tuygw) is licensed under CC BY 4.0. Article caption explicitly links to the complete BioRender asset; may correspond to a panel or construction sheet rather than the entire published figure.",
      "copyright": [
        "Copyright © 2026 Zhen, Wang, Wang, Huang, Li and Zhao."
      ]
