      "caption": "Fig. 1\n\nA spatial transcriptomic atlas of post-irradiation intestinal regeneration.\n\na Visium HD experimental design: n = 4 capture areas; 23 biological samples; D0 (non-irradiated), n = 5; D1, n = 3; D2, n = 4; D3, n = 3; D4, n = 4; D5, n = 3; D6, n = 1). Created in BioRender. Ofer, R. (2026) https://BioRender.com/k6p4uhz. b ~ 2.8 billion unique reads; ~ 26 million 2-µm bins across 4 capture areas, 16,921 genes detected. c Representative capture area (rep2) by timepoint and graph-based clustering of cell-segmented 2-µm bins; similar clustering observed across all replicates (Supplementary Fig. 1a). d Mean normalized log2 expression of top upregulated genes per cluster. e Five crypt-villus epithelial clusters, non-irradiated tissue, rep2; cell-segmented 2-µm or 8-µm bins. Non-epithelial bins excluded. f Z-score heatmap of the villus zonation gene set17 (Moor et al.) across the five D0 epithelial clusters. Z-scores were calculated from log2FC values of differential expression between the five epithelial clusters (Loupe Browser; two-sided negative binomial-based test with Benjamini–Hochberg correction). g GO enrichment of the five D0 epithelial clusters; gene number per zone listed. DEGs (as in (f)) were filtered (log2FC > 1, adj. P < 0.05, MNA > 0.03) and analyzed by GO enrichment in DAVID73,74 (modified Fisher’s exact test (EASE score), Benjamini–Hochberg correction). Full GO results in Supplementary Data 1. h Loupe Browser spatial expression of villus zonation markers; similar pattern observed across replicates. i\nIsg15+ expressed as villi clusters at days 0, 1 and 3 post-IR (log2-transformed UMI); a similar pattern observed across replicates. j GO enrichment, Isg15+ vs. Isg15− bins, D0; upregulation of interferon-associated pathways. Smooth muscle, enteric neuron, crypt and crypt-stroma bins excluded. Top enriched terms selected. Gene sets from GO21: GO:0051607, GO:0009615, GO:0002376, GO:0045087, GO:0045071. Complete GO results in Supplementary Data 2. k Z-score heatmap of interferon-stimulated genes in Isg15+ bins at D0 across all replicates. Z-scores calculated as in (f) for Isg15+ vs. Isg15− bins. l Percentage of Isg15+ villus bins across the four biological replicates. n = 5(D0), 3(D1), 3(D2), 3(D3), 2(D4), 2(D5), 1(D6); 2 of the D4 samples included. Mean ± SEM. Scale bar: 10 µm (b); 1 mm (c); 100 µm (e, h, i) and 500 µm (i). Source data are provided as a Source Data file.",
