      "condition": "Specific BioRender page explicitly licenses this Completed Graphic under CC BY 4.0; individual BioRender icons may not be extracted and redistributed separately. Article permissions cover the saved author text under CC BY 4.0. Selected excerpts and captions contain no identified credit requiring separate permission. Other article images are omitted. Image bytes unchanged; complete BioRender public PNG, no cropping or icon extraction. Original-language article paragraphs and linked captions converted from JATS XML to Markdown; styling removed, no OCR, translation or paraphrase. Graphic: Possible scenarios of B chromosome (in blue) behaviour during cell division.. Creator: Lucie Hloušková. Provider: BioRender. Asset source: https://biorender.com/lx3yoo9. License evidence: https://app.biorender.com/citation/6a4ca9debbf53eae89e3f271. “Possible scenarios of B chromosome (in blue) behaviour during cell division.” created in BioRender. Hloušková, L. (https://BioRender.com/lx3yoo9) is licensed under CC BY 4.0. Article caption explicitly links to the complete BioRender asset; may correspond to a panel or construction sheet rather than the entire published figure.",
