      "authors": "Maria Ormhøj; Kamilla Kjærgaard Munk; Siri Tvingsholm; Keerthana Ramanathan; Amalie Kai Bentzen; Georgios Kladis; Gitte Nygaard Aasbjerg; Grigorii Nos; Tripti Tamhane; Hólmfridur Rósa Halldórsdóttir; Søren Nyboe Jakobsen; Marcus Svensson Frej; Kristoffer Haurum Johansen; Mohammad Kadivar; Sine Reker Hadrup",
