      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2\n\nSchematic representation of the ‘one-pot’ HDA-RCA assay. The protocol includes three sequential steps at 65 °C: (1) asymmetric HDA preamplification; (2) padlock probe ligation; and (3) exponential RCA with biotin-dUTP incorporation (dUTPb). The biotin-labeled amplification products are then visualized using a streptavidin-HRP-TMB colorimetric system, producing a blue signal for positive samples. Created in BioRender. Chirkova, P. (2026) https://BioRender.com/wtewdnh (accessed on 13 March 2026).",
