      "caption": "Figure 1: Overview of the method's architecture. The subfigs exhibit the training process for our interpretable language method. (la) The BERT encoder is firstly fine-tuned under the downstream task. We map the feature F B from fine-tuned BERT encoder to the word elements C in W2CSpace (\"T\" refer to \"trained\"); (1b) After the training of the mapping network with a reconstruction and alignment task, the word semantics are clustered to high-dimensional context semantics X; (1c) During interpretable language modeling process, the context semantics in W2CSpace is gradually optimized by multiplying the merge matrix M M. We compute the context-relative distance of the mapped feature C within the optimized context X for the downstream task.",
