      "caption": "Figure 1: The overall framework of STF (We omit the first stage of STF.). Given an unlabeled sentence W: (1) run an event extraction model to compute event predictions and an AMR parser to parse it into an AMR graph; (2) map the predicted trigger and argument to corresponding nodes in the AMR graph, find their AMR path and combine it with the predicted event type and argument role into a new sequence (Life:Die, killed, ARGO, commandos, ARGO, PLACE, Iraq, Other); (3) feed the sequence into the scoring model to compute a compatibility score; (4) leverage the pseudo label and compatibility score to further update the event extraction model.",
