      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1: Feedback-based automatic prompt engineering methods commonly employ a meta-prompt , which guides LLMs to evaluate the current case, provide feedbacks , and generate refined prompts . In this work, we design an instructive meta-prompt to select exemplars with detailed solution processes, and generate feedbacks for the current case. These feedbacks are stored in Feedback Memory and periodically retrieved to efficiently guide the optimization of prompts . Additionally, these exemplars are stored and assessed in an Exemplar Factory to enhance prediction accuracy.",
