      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1: Training details of MuDiT/MuSiT. It includes three stages: module preparation, pre-training, and finetuning. In the module preparation stage, we fine-tune a lyric large language model (LLM) using structured lyrics, train a ChinMu cross-modal encoder using audio along with professional and amateur descriptions, and train VAE encoder and decoder using audio. In the pre-training stage, we utilize raw lyrics and audio to pre-train DiT or SiT. During the fine-tuning stage, we optimize the pre-trained DiT or SiT, treating professional and amateur descriptions as well as structured lyrics as conditioning factors.",
