      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1. An illustration of how BPIPE deals with a memory imbalance problem. With the 1F1B pipeline schedule (left), the memory requirement of an earlier pipeline stage could exceed the memory capacity of a GPU. In that case, training is not feasible even if the total aggregated memory is sufficient for the memory requirement. BPIPE (right) balances the imbalanced memory requirement by transferring intermediate activations between earlier and later stages.",
