      "caption": "Figure 1: Our model SemSup-XC achieves state-of-the-art performance on zero-shot and few-shot extreme classification through three innovations - large-scale automated class description collection with heuristic filtering to improve semantic understanding of classes, contrastive learning to make training faster by over 99% when compared to the previous work (SEMSUP), and 3 a novel lexico-semantic matching model building called Hybrid-Match to utilize both semantic similarity at the sentence level and contextual lexico-semantic similarity at the token level.",
