      "title": "STAIR: Improving Safety Alignment with Introspective Reasoning",
      "authors": "Yichi Zhang; Siyuan Zhang; Yao Huang; Zeyu Xia; Zhengwei Fang; Xiao Yang; Ranjie Duan; Dong Yan; Yinpeng Dong; Jun Zhu",
      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1. Although the existing safety alignment methods enable LLMs to refuse queries with apparent risks directly, they often fail to resist jailbreak attacks that manage to avoid the initial tokens for refusal. The instinctive responses correspond to System 1 thinking. In this paper, we propose to improve safety alignment with introspective reasoning, encouraging LLMs to scrutinize the underlying risks with safety-aware System 2 thinking before making refusals.",
