      "id": "119f1b71",
      "diagram": "diagram/119f1b71.jpg",
      "class": "Conceptual Framework",
      "domain": "2",
      "title": "Underestimated Privacy Risks for Minority Populations in Large Language Model Unlearning",
      "authors": "Rongzhe Wei; Mufei Li; Mohsen Ghassemi; Eleonora Kreacic; Yifan Li; Xiang Yue; Bo Li; Vamsi K. Potluru; Pan Li; Eli Chien",
      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1. Illustration of our proposed LLM unlearning approaches (highlighted in red), when compared with the existing pipeline. Standard LLM unlearning evaluation typically involves randomly sampling data for removal from the training set (Case 1), which may underestimate privacy leakage for minority groups. In contrast, we design experiments to assess unlearning efficacy by removing canaries (deliberately inserted data points) related to minority groups (Case 2) and by directly removing data from minority groups (Case 3). Our approach provides a more comprehensive, minority-aware evaluation by considering the worst result across the three settings.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://proceedings.mlr.press/v267/wei25d.html",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "condition": "Share publicly, unchanged and for noncommercial purposes. Retain the authors, paper source, copyright and license links. Preserve the original JPG bytes and the original caption from the same version; do not redraw, translate or paraphrase. The gallery's original JPG files were copied byte for byte, without redrawing, translation, color adjustment or re-encoding. The gallery images were rendered and cropped from PDFs; some include adjacent text or omit edges. Their existing state on the original site is preserved.The original captions from the same version were rendered directly as PNG files, without OCR, translation, paraphrasing or reformatting of equations. Rongzhe Wei; Mufei Li; Mohsen Ghassemi; Eleonora Kreacic; Yifan Li; Xiang Yue; Bo Li; Vamsi K. Potluru; Pan Li; Eli Chien. Underestimated Privacy Risks for Minority Populations in Large Language Model Unlearning. ICML 2025, Figure 1. Source: https://proceedings.mlr.press/v267/wei25d.html. CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. The gallery's original JPG files were copied byte for byte, without redrawing, translation, color adjustment or re-encoding. The gallery images were rendered and cropped from PDFs; some include adjacent text or omit edges. Their existing state on the original site is preserved.The original captions from the same version were rendered directly as PNG files, without OCR, translation, paraphrasing or reformatting of equations. Caption source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/main/assets/wei25d/wei25d.pdf. Caption license: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). The original-language caption was transcribed from the source caption image into plain text; line breaks, typography and mathematical notation were normalized. No translation or paraphrase was intended.",
