      "authors": "Alessandro Palma; Sergei Rybakov; Leon Hetzel; Stephan Günnemann; Fabian J Theis",
      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1. Visual conceptualisation of the FlatVI approach. The decoder of a single-cell VAE maps to the parameter space of a negative binomial statistical manifold of probability distributions. In standard VAE settings, straight latent paths are not guaranteed to map to meaningful statistical manifold interpolations through the decoder. By regularising the pullback metric of the stochastic decoder, FlatVI induces correspondence between straight paths in the latent space and geodesic interpolations along the manifold of the decoded space.",
