      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1. How an Activation Oracle exposes a hidden objective. A suspect model is fine-tuned to play the game Taboo: the model must guide the user to guess a secret target word (\"tree\") without ever saying the word itself. Step l: We run the suspect model on a prompt, then collect its activations at the assistant token (Left). Step 2: We inject these activations into new prompts and ask natural language questions about them (Right). Another model, the Activation Oracle, reveals both the suspect model's goal and the secret word.",
