      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1. Illustration of neuroscience criteria for AI engram. The engram μ of target concept c is identified as the causal substrate satisfying: i) Specificity: selective encoding of target experience X relative to reference X ; i) Reactivation: consistent reproduction of learned internal representations Z; ii) Sufficiency: memory induction via injection of μ into the null state μnull; iv) Necessity: memory elimination via surgical ablation of μt from the learned state μall.",
