      "domain": "0",
      "title": "LIMSSR: LLM-Driven Sequence-to-Score Reasoning under Training-Time Incomplete Multimodal Observations",
      "authors": "Xu, Huangbiao; Wu, Huanqi; Ke, Xiao; Peng, Yuxin",
      "figure": "Figure 1",
      "caption": "Figure 1. (a) Reconstruction-based and (b) Distillation/Prior-based incomplete multimodal learning methods typically rely on the unrealistic “full-modal training\" assumption to generate missing data or distill priors. In contrast, (c) our LIMSSR leverages the contextaware reasoning capabilities of LLMs to infer latent semantics from available modalities under the more challenging Training- Time Incomplete Observations, eliminating the dependency on complete training data or reconstruction supervision.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.00434",
